### =====================================================
### Social Link - POST /account/social/link
### Vincula una cuenta externa (google / facebook / apple)
### al usuario autenticado
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Vincular cuenta de Google (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "idToken": "ID_TOKEN_DEL_SDK_DE_GOOGLE"
}

### Test 2: idToken inválido o expirado — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "idToken": "TOKEN_INVALIDO"
}

### Test 3: Cuenta ya vinculada a otro usuario — 409 (EXTERNAL_LINK_CONFLICT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "idToken": "ID_TOKEN_DE_CUENTA_YA_VINCULADA"
}

### Test 4: Sin token — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/social/link
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "idToken": "ID_TOKEN_DEL_SDK_DE_GOOGLE"
}

### Test 5: Campo requerido faltante (sin provider) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/social/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "ID_TOKEN_DEL_SDK_DE_GOOGLE"
}
